const List<GeoTopic> islamiatTopics = <GeoTopic>[
  GeoTopic(
    id: "quran",
    title: "Quran Majeed — Mukammal Details",
    subtitle: "قرآن مجید کی woh saari details jo one paper me baar baar poochi jati hain",
    portion: "islamiat",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("PPSC aur FPSC ke one paper me Islamiat ka hissa har saal ata hai, aur us hisse me sab se zyada sawal Quran Majeed se bante hain. Kabhi poocha jata hai ke suraton ki tadaad kitni hai, kabhi ye ke sab se lambi surah konsi hai, kabhi ye ke Quran kis ke dor me jama hua. Ye sawal mushkil nahi hote, bas in ke jawab pakke hone chahiyein. Masla ye hai ke bazar me ghumne wale aam numbers me se kuch ghalat hain, aur paper bilkul unhi ghalat numbers ko option me rakh kar phansata hai. Is lesson me hum har number ko us ki sahi surat me bithaenge, aur jahan koi mashhoor ghalat fehmi hai, wahan use pehle se nishan laga kar rakhenge taake paper me tum use dekhte hi pehchan lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle Quran ko samajh lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Quran Majeed Allah Taala ki woh kitab hai jo Hazrat Muhammad صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم par wahi ke zariye nazil hui. Wahi ka matlab hai Allah ka woh paigham jo farishte Hazrat Jibrail علیہ السلام ke zariye Nabi tak pohchaya gaya. Ye kitab aik din me ya aik saal me nahi utri. Is ke nazil hone ka silsila takreeban 23 saal tak chala. Pehle 13 saal Makkah Mukarrama me guzre aur baqi 10 saal Madina Munawwara me. Isi liye hum kehte hain ke Quran ki mukammal wahi 23 saal me nazil hui, aur ye 23 wala number paper ka sab se pyara sawal hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehli wahi kab aur kahan nazil hui"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab suno woh baat jahan se saari kahani shuru hoti hai. 610 Eiswi me, Ramzan ke mahine me, Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم Makkah ke qareeb Jabal-e-Noor ki aik ghaar me ibadat me mashghool thay. Us ghaar ka naam hai غارِ حرا, Ghar-e-Hira. Wahin Hazrat Jibrail علیہ السلام tashreef laye aur pehli wahi nazil hui. Pehli wahi me سورۃ العلق ki pehli paanch ayaat nazil huin, jin ka pehla lafz hai اِقْرَأ, yani parho. Dekho, Islam ki pehli wahi ka pehla lafz hi ilm ke bare me hai, ye baat paper me bhi ati hai aur zehen me bithane ke liye bhi khoobsurat hai. To teen cheezain aik sath yaad kar lo. Pehli wahi 610 Eiswi, jagah Ghar-e-Hira, aur nazil hone wali ayaat Surah Alaq ki pehli paanch."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ab numbers ka poora hisaab"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/quran-facts.jpg", caption: "The Quran in Numbers — 114 Surahs, 30 Paras, 6,236 Ayahs"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab hum us hisse me ate hain jahan paper sab se zyada khelta hai. Quran Majeed ki kul suratain 114 hain. Har surah ayaat par mushtamil hoti hai, aur ayat ka matlab hai nishani. Kul ayaat ki tadaad 6236 hai. Yahan ruk kar aik zaroori baat sun lo. Tum ne bazar me aur aam kitabon me 6666 ka number bohat suna hoga. Ye number mashhoor zaroor hai lekin durust nahi hai. Mustanad tadaad 6236 hai. Paper hamesha 6666 ko option me rakhta hai taake woh student phanse jo suna sunaya number likhta hai. Aaj ke baad tumhare zehen me sirf 6236 rahega."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Quran ko 30 barabar hison me taqseem kiya gaya hai, har hisse ko para kehte hain aur Arabic me isay juz kehte hain. Kul paray 30 hain. Tilawat ki asani ke liye Quran ko 7 manzilon me bhi taqseem kiya gaya hai, taake aik haftay me poora Quran khatam ho sake. Manzil ki tadaad 7 hai. Is ke ilawa har surah ke andar rukne ki jaghon ko ruku kehte hain, aur kul ruku 540 hain. Aur jin ayaat par sajda wajib hota hai unhe sajda-e-tilawat kehte hain, aur woh ayaat 14 hain. Ab in numbers ko aik saans me dohra lo. Suratain 114, paray 30, ayaat 6236, ruku 540, sajday 14, manzilain 7. Ye cheh numbers paper ki jaan hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Makki aur Madani suratain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Quran ki suraton ko un ke nazil hone ke zamane ke hisab se do hison me taqseem kiya jata hai. Jo suratain Hijrat se pehle nazil huin, chahe woh Makkah ke ilawa kahin aur nazil hui hon, woh Makki kahlati hain. Aur jo suratain Hijrat ke baad nazil huin woh Madani kahlati hain. Yahan aik bareek nukta hai jo paper bohat pasand karta hai. Taqseem jagah ki nahi, zamane ki hai. Hijrat se pehle wali Makki, Hijrat ke baad wali Madani, jagah chahe jo bhi ho. Makki suraton me aam tor par tauheed, risalat, akhiraat aur pichli qaumon ke waqiat bayan hote hain, aur in ki ayaat aam tor par chhoti hoti hain. Madani suraton me ibadat, muamilaat, qawaneen aur muasharti ahkam tafseel se ate hain, aur in ki ayaat aam tor par lambi hoti hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Tadaad ki baat karo to standard jawab ye hai ke 86 suratain Makki hain aur 28 suratain Madani. Kuch ulama ke nazdeek chand suraton ki taqseem me ikhtilaf hai, is liye baaz kitabon me ye tadaad thori mukhtalif milti hai, lekin paper ke liye standard jawab 86 aur 28 hi hai. Jab bhi sawal aye to yehi do numbers likhne hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sab se lambi aur sab se chhoti surah"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab do suratain aisi hain jin ke baghair Islamiat ka paper adhoora rehta hai. Quran ki sab se lambi surah hai سورۃ البقرہ, Surah Al-Baqarah. Ye dusra para se shuru hoti hai aur is ki ayaat 286 hain. Baqarah ka matlab hai gaye, aur is surah me Bani Israel ki us gaye ka waqia bayan hua hai jis ki wajah se is ka ye naam para. Aur Quran ki sab se chhoti surah hai سورۃ الکوثر, Surah Al-Kausar, jis ki sirf 3 ayaat hain. Lambi wali ke 286 aur chhoti wali ke 3, ye jora hamesha sath yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehli surah aur aakhri wahi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Quran ki tartib me sab se pehli surah hai سورۃ الفاتحہ, Surah Al-Fateha. Ise Umm-ul-Quran yani Quran ki maa bhi kaha jata hai, aur ye har namaz ki har rakat me parhi jati hai. Ab dusri taraf dekho. Aakhri wahi ke bare me standard riwayat ye hai ke sab se aakhir me nazil hone wali ayat Surah Al-Baqarah ki ayat number 281 hai, jis me Allah ki taraf lotne ka zikr hai. Aur aakhri mukammal surah jo nazil hui woh سورۃ النصر, Surah An-Nasr hai. Paper kabhi aakhri ayat poochta hai aur kabhi aakhri surah, dono ka jawab alag alag zehen me rakho. Aakhri ayat Baqarah ki 281, aakhri mukammal surah An-Nasr."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Do suratain jin ke laqab paper me ate hain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Surah Yaseen ko Quran ka dil kaha jata hai. Ye laqab itna mashhoor hai ke paper me seedha poocha jata hai ke Quran ka dil konsi surah hai, jawab سورۃ یٰسین. Dusri taraf آیت الکرسی hai. Ayat-ul-Kursi Surah Al-Baqarah ki ayat number 255 hai, aur ise Quran ki sab se azeem ayat kaha jata hai. Is me Allah Taala ki qudrat aur us ki kursi ki wusat bayan hui hai. To do baatain pakki kar lo. Quran ka dil Surah Yaseen, aur sab se azeem ayat Ayat-ul-Kursi jo Baqarah ki 255 number ayat hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Bismillah wala woh sawal jo sab ko phansata hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Har surah ke shuru me بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ ati hai, lekin aik surah aisi hai jis ke shuru me Bismillah nahi hai. Woh hai سورۃ التوبہ, Surah At-Tauba, Quran ki nawein surah. Is ke bilkul ult, aik surah aisi hai jis me Bismillah do martaba ati hai. Woh hai سورۃ النمل, Surah An-Naml. Aik martaba surah ke shuru me, aur dusri martaba us ayat me jahan Hazrat Sulaiman علیہ السلام ka khat Malika Bilqees ki taraf bheja gaya aur khat ki ibtida Bismillah se hui. To jora yaad rakho. Bina Bismillah wali Tauba, do Bismillah wali Naml."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Huroof-e-Muqattaat kya hain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Baz suraton ke shuru me kuch munqata huroof ate hain, jese الم ya حم. Inhe حروفِ مقطعات kehte hain, yani alag alag parhe jane wale huroof. Jin suraton ke shuru me ye huroof ate hain un ki tadaad 29 hai. In huroof ke asal maani ke bare me ulama ka khayal hai ke in ka ilm Allah Taala hi ke paas hai, lekin paper ke liye jo cheez zaroori hai woh sirf ye hai ke in ka naam Huroof-e-Muqattaat hai aur aisi suratain 29 hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Katib-e-Wahy kon thay"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jab koi wahi nazil hoti to Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم use foran likhwa dete thay. Jin Sahaba ko ye saadat hasil hui unhe کاتبِ وحی kehte hain, yani wahi likhne wale. Katibeen-e-Wahy me Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit رضی اللہ عنہ ka naam sab se numayan hai, is ke ilawa Khulafa-e-Rashideen aur degar Sahaba bhi is farize ko anjam dete rahe. Us zamane me kagaz aam nahi tha, is liye wahi khajoor ki tehniyon, safed patharon, chamre ke tukron aur hadiyon par likhi jati thi, aur Sahaba use seene me mehfooz bhi karte thay. Katib-e-Wahy ka sawal paper me ata hai, aur is me Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit ka naam sab se aham is liye hai ke aage chal kar Quran ko jama karne ki zimmadari bhi inhi ko mili."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Quran jama kesay hua"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab woh kahani suno jo paper me do sawalon ki surat me ati hai. Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم ke is duniya se tashreef le jane ke baad Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddique رضی اللہ عنہ ke dor me Jang-e-Yamama lari gayi. Us jang me bohat se Sahaba shaheed hue jin ke seenon me Quran mehfooz tha. Hazrat Umar رضی اللہ عنہ ko fikr hui ke agar Huffaz is tarah shaheed hote rahe to Quran ke kisi hisse ke zaya hone ka khadsha hai. Unhon ne Hazrat Abu Bakr ko mashwara diya ke Quran ko aik jagah jama kar liya jaye. Is kaam ki zimmadari Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit رضی اللہ عنہ ko di gayi. Unhon ne sakht ehtiyat ke sath, har ayat ko likhe hue nuskhe aur Huffaz ki gawahi se mila kar, poore Quran ko aik mus'haf ki surat me jama kar diya. Ye pehli jam'a thi, aur ye Hazrat Abu Bakr ke dor me hui."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Phir Hazrat Usman غنی رضی اللہ عنہ ke dor me Islam bohat door door tak phail gaya. Mukhtalif ilaqon me qiraat ke farq par ikhtilaf hone laga. Hazrat Usman ne wohi mus'haf jo Hazrat Abu Bakr ke dor me tayyar hua tha, us ki buniyad par Quran ke mustanad nuskhe tayyar karwa kar bare bare shehron me bhijwa diye, taake poori ummat aik hi tartib aur aik hi qiraat par muttahid ho jaye. Isi azeem khidmat ki wajah se Hazrat Usman ko جامع القرآن, Jami-ul-Quran kaha jata hai, yani Quran ko jama karne wale. Ab yahin ruk kar aik aur laqab bhi jor lo. Hazrat Usman ko ذوالنورین, Zun-Noorain bhi kaha jata hai, jis ka matlab hai do nooron wale. Wajah ye hai ke un ke nikah me yakke baad deegre Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم ki do sahibzadian, pehle Hazrat Ruqayya رضی اللہ عنہا aur un ke intiqal ke baad Hazrat Umm-e-Kulsoom رضی اللہ عنہا, ayin. To do laqab aur un ke dor alag alag yaad rakho. Pehli jam'a Hazrat Abu Bakr ke dor me, mustanad nuskha Hazrat Usman ke dor me, aur Jami-ul-Quran ka laqab bhi Hazrat Usman hi ka hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Quran ke dusre naam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Quran Majeed ko khud Quran ke andar mukhtalif namon se pukara gaya hai, aur paper in namon ko bhi poochta hai. الفرقان, Al-Furqan, yani haq aur batil me farq karne wala. الکتاب, Al-Kitab, yani woh kitab. الذکر, Az-Zikr, yani nasihat aur yaad dehani. الھدیٰ, Al-Huda, yani hidayat. Ye chaar naam Quran hi ke diye hue hain, is liye jab sawal aye ke in me se konsa naam Quran ka hai to ghabrane ki zaroorat nahi, chaaron hi Quran ke naam hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Quran me Ambiya ka zikr"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Quran Majeed me 25 Ambiya کرام ke naam ke sath zikr aya hai. In me Hazrat Adam, Hazrat Nooh, Hazrat Ibrahim, Hazrat Musa, Hazrat Isa علیہم السلام aur degar Ambiya shamil hain. 25 wala number is liye yaad rakho ke paper me aksar poocha jata hai ke Quran me kul kitne Ambiya ke naam aye hain. Jawab 25 hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paron ke naam kesay bane"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me aik dilchasp baat jo tumhe paron ke naam yaad karne me madad degi. Har paray ka naam us paray ke pehle lafz ya pehle huroof se liya gaya hai. Pehle paray ka naam الم hai kyunke woh inhi huroof se shuru hota hai. Dusre paray ka naam سیقول hai kyunke us ki ibtida is lafz se hoti hai. To para ka naam koi alag se ratne wali cheez nahi, bas us paray ki pehli ibaraat hi us ka naam hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paper ke fix facts ki recap"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab saari baatain aik jagah dohra lo, kyunke paper inhi se banta hai. Wahi ki kul muddat 23 saal. Pehli wahi 610 Eiswi me Ghar-e-Hira me nazil hui, aur woh Surah Alaq ki pehli paanch ayaat thin. Suratain 114, paray 30, ayaat 6236, aur 6666 wala number ghalat mashhoor hai, use option me dekh kar phansna nahi. Ruku 540, sajda-e-tilawat 14, manzilain 7. Makki suratain 86 aur Madani 28, aur taqseem jagah ki nahi zamane ki hai. Sab se lambi surah Baqarah, ayaat 286. Sab se chhoti surah Kausar, ayaat 3. Pehli surah Fateha, jis ka laqab Umm-ul-Quran hai. Aakhri ayat Baqarah ki 281, aakhri mukammal surah An-Nasr. Quran ka dil Surah Yaseen. Sab se azeem ayat Ayat-ul-Kursi, Baqarah ki 255. Bina Bismillah wali surah Tauba, do Bismillah wali Naml. Huroof-e-Muqattaat wali suratain 29. Quran me naam ke sath 25 Ambiya ka zikr hai. Pehli jam'a Hazrat Abu Bakr ke dor me Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit ke zariye hui, aur mustanad nuskha Hazrat Usman ke dor me tayyar hua, isiliye un ka laqab Jami-ul-Quran hai, aur dusra laqab Zun-Noorain hai. Ye saari baatain pakki kar lo, to Quran wala koi sawal tumhe nahi phansa sakta."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "hadees",
    title: "Hadees — Tareef, Aqsaam aur Mashhoor Kitabein",
    subtitle: "حدیث کی pehchan, us ki qismein, aur woh chhe kitabein jin se paper banta hai",
    portion: "islamiat",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Quran ke baad one paper me sab se zyada sawal Hadees se ate hain. Kabhi poocha jata hai ke hadees ki tareef kya hai, kabhi ye ke Sihah Sitta me konsi kitabein shamil hain, aur kabhi ye ke sab se mustanad kitab hadees konsi hai. Ye sawal un students ko phansate hain jo hadees ko bas aik lafz samajh kar agay barh jate hain. Asal baat ye hai ke hadees apne andar aik poora nizam rakhti hai. Us ke hisse hain, us ki qismein hain, use parakhne ka aik ilm hai, aur phir woh mashhoor kitabein hain jin me use mehfooz kiya gaya. Is lesson me hum ye saara nizam aik tartib se bithaenge, taake paper me hadees ka sawal jis pehlu se bhi aye, tum use pehchan lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hadees ki tareef pehle samajh lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hadees kise kehte hain, ye baat teen lafzon me band hai. Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم ka qawl, aap ka fail, aur aap ki taqreer. Qawl ka matlab hai aap ki farmayi hui baat. Fail ka matlab hai aap ka kiya hua koi amal. Aur taqreer wo cheez hai jo aksar students se reh jati hai. Taqreer ka matlab hai ke koi kaam aap ke samne kiya gaya aur aap ne use dekh kar khamoshi ikhtiyar ki ya use barqarar rakha, yani aap ki khamoshi hi us kaam ki manzoori ban gayi. To jab bhi hadees ki tareef poochi jaye to ye teenon hisse lazmi bayan karo. Qawl, fail aur taqreer. Teesra hissa bhoolna hi paper me number katwane ke barabar hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Har hadees ke do hisse hote hain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab hadees ki banawat samjho. Har hadees do hison par mushtamil hoti hai. Pehla hissa hai سند, sanad. Sanad woh zanjeer hai un logon ki jin ke zariye ye hadees hum tak pohchi. Falan ne falan se suna, unhon ne falan se suna, is tarah ye silsila chalte chalte Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم tak pohchta hai. Dusra hissa hai متن, matan. Matan woh asal ibaraat hai jo hadees ka mazmoon hai, yani woh baat jo bayan ki gayi. Aik asaan misaal se samjho. Sanad woh rasta hai jis se khabar ayi, aur matan woh khabar khud hai. Paper me sanad aur matan ki tareef alag alag bhi ati hai aur dono ka farq bhi poocha jata hai. Jo shakhs hadees bayan karta hai use راوی, ravi kehte hain, aur us ke bayan karne ke amal ko riwayat kehte hain. Ravi aur riwayat, ye jora bhi yahin yaad kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hadees-e-Qudsi aur Hadees-e-Nabawi ka farq"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab woh farq ata hai jo paper ka sab se fix trap hai, aur jis par har saal sawal banta hai. Hadees ki aik qism hai حدیثِ قدسی, Hadees-e-Qudsi. Qudsi woh hadees hai jis ka maana aur mazmoon Allah Taala ki taraf se hota hai, lekin alfaaz Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم ke hote hain. Yani baat Allah ki, bayan Nabi ka. Is me Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم baat ko Allah ki taraf mansoob kar ke bayan farmate hain, ke Allah Taala farmata hai. Dusri taraf حدیثِ نبوی hai. Nabawi hadees woh hai jo Huzoor صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم ka apna qawl, fail ya taqreer ho, aur use aap apni taraf se bayan farmayein. To farq aik line me ye hai. Qudsi me maana Allah ka aur alfaaz Nabi ke, Nabawi me qawl o amal Nabi hi ka. Aur aik baat yahan wazeh kar dun ke Hadees-e-Qudsi Quran nahi hai. Quran woh wahi hai jis ke alfaaz bhi Allah ke hain aur maana bhi, jabke Qudsi me alfaaz Nabi ke hain. Ye bareek farq hi paper ka asal imtihan hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sanad ke hisab se hadees ki aqsaam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hadees ko is buniyad par bhi taqseem kiya jata hai ke woh hum tak kitne ravioun ke zariye pohchi. Pehli qism hai Mutawatir. Mutawatir woh hadees hai jise har zamane me itni barri tadaad me ravioun ne bayan kiya ho ke un sab ka jhoot par ikatha hona mumkin hi na ho. Aisi hadees ka ilm yaqeeni hota hai. Dusri qism hai Ahad. Ahad woh hadees hai jis ke bayan karne wale ravioun ki tadaad Mutawatir ki had tak na pohchi ho, chahe woh aik ravi ho ya chand ravi. Aam kitabein hadees ki aksar Ahad hi hoti hain. Paper ke liye itna pakka kar lo ke tadaad ki kasrat aur yaqeen wali hadees Mutawatir hai, aur is se kam darje wali Ahad."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sihah Sitta kya hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab hum un kitabon ki taraf ate hain jin par Islamiat ka paper khara hota hai. Hadees ki chhe sab se mustanad aur mashhoor kitabon ko ملا kar صحاحِ ستہ, Sihah Sitta kaha jata hai. Sitta ka matlab hai chhe. Ye chhe kitabein hain, Sahih Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, Sunan Abu Dawood, Jami Tirmizi, Sunan Nasa'i aur Sunan Ibn Majah. In chhe ke naam aur in ke musannifeen ke naam aik sath ratne ki bajaaye samajh kar yaad karo, kyunke paper kabhi kitab de kar musannif poochta hai aur kabhi musannif de kar kitab. Ab hum har kitab ko bari bari dekhte hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sahih Bukhari, sab se mustanad kitab"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehli aur sab se buland kitab hai صحیح بخاری, Sahih Bukhari. Is ke musannif hain Imam Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari رحمۃ اللہ علیہ. Imam Bukhari ne hadees ki talash me door door ke safar kiye aur aik riwayat ke mutabiq unhon ne takreeban chhe lakh, yani 600,000 ahadees se intikhab kar ke apni kitab tayyar ki. Kitab me takrar ke sath takreeban 7,275 ahadees hain, aur takrar nikalo to ye tadaad takreeban 2,602 reh jati hai. Imam Bukhari ne har hadees ke liye sanad ki sakht tareen shartein rakhin, isiliye un ki kitab ko Quran ke baad sab se mustanad aur sab se sahi kitab mana jata hai, aur ise اصح الکتب بعد کتاب اللہ bhi kaha jata hai. Paper ka sab se seedha sawal yahin se ata hai. Sab se mustanad kitab hadees konsi hai, jawab Sahih Bukhari."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sahih Muslim, dusri mustanad kitab"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dusri kitab hai صحیح مسلم, Sahih Muslim. Is ke musannif hain Imam Muslim bin Hajjaj رحمۃ اللہ علیہ, jo Nishapur ke rehne wale thay. Imam Muslim ne bhi apni kitab me sirf wohi ahadees rakhin jin ki sanad un ki sakht sharton par poori utri. Tartib aur tasnif ke aitbar se Sahih Muslim ko khaas maqam hasil hai. Bukhari aur Muslim dono ko mila kar صحیحین, Sahihain kaha jata hai, yani woh do sahi kitabein. Sahihain ka lafz paper me ata hai, aur is se murad hamesha yehi do kitabein hoti hain, Bukhari aur Muslim."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Baqi chaar kitabein"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Teesri kitab hai سنن ابی داؤد, Sunan Abu Dawood, jis ke musannif Imam Abu Dawood Sulaiman bin Ash'as hain. Is kitab me khaas tor par woh ahadees jama ki gayin jin se roz marra ke fiqhi masail aur ahkam nikalte hain. Chauthi kitab hai جامع ترمذی, Jami Tirmizi, jis ke musannif Imam Muhammad bin Isa Tirmizi hain. Imam Tirmizi ki kitab ki pehchan ye hai ke woh har hadees ke sath us ka darja bhi bayan kar dete hain, ke ye hadees sahih hai, hasan hai ya zaeef hai. Panchwin kitab hai سنن نسائی, Sunan Nasa'i, jis ke musannif Imam Ahmad bin Shu'aib Nasa'i hain. In ki kitab sanad ki jaanch me apni sakhti ki wajah se mashhoor hai. Chhati kitab hai سنن ابن ماجہ, Sunan Ibn Majah, jis ke musannif Imam Muhammad bin Yazid Ibn Majah hain. In chhe kitabon ko mila kar Sihah Sitta banta hai. Tartib yaad rakhne ka asaan tareeqa ye hai ke pehle do Sahih hain, Bukhari aur Muslim, aur baqi chaar Sunan aur Jami hain, Abu Dawood, Tirmizi, Nasa'i aur Ibn Majah."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Muwatta Imam Malik, pehli tadween shuda kitab"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab aik woh kitab jo Sihah Sitta me shamil nahi, lekin jis ke baghair hadees ki tareekh adhoori hai. وہ ہے موطا امام مالک, Muwatta Imam Malik. Imam Malik bin Anas رحمۃ اللہ علیہ Madina Munawwara ke Imam thay. Un ki kitab Muwatta ko hadees ki sab se pehli baqaida tadween shuda mashhoor kitab mana jata hai, yani hadees ko kitab ki surat me jama karne ka woh silsila jo baad ki tamam kitabon ki buniyad bana, us ki mashhoor tareen ibtida yahin se hoti hai. Sihah Sitta wali kitabein is ke baad ke zamane ki hain. Paper me jab poocha jaye ke hadees ki pehli tadween shuda kitab konsi hai to jawab Muwatta Imam Malik hai, aur jab sab se mustanad poochi jaye to jawab Sahih Bukhari hai. In dono sawalon ko uljhana hi sab se barri ghalti hai, dono ke jawab alag alag bitha lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hadees parakhi kesay jati hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aakhir me ye samajh lo ke kisi hadees ko sahi ya zaeef kesay kaha jata hai. Is kaam ka buniyadi ilm hai علم الرجال, Ilm-e-Rijal, yani ravioun ke halaat ka ilm. Is ilm me har ravi ki zindagi ko parkha jata hai. Woh sachha tha ya nahi, us ki yaaddasht kesi thi, us ne hadees kis se suni aur us ke ustad se us ki mulaqat sabit hai ya nahi. Sanad ki har kari ko is tarah jaanch kar muhaddiseen hadees ka darja tay karte thay. Yahi wajah hai ke Imam Bukhari jaise muhaddiseen ne lakhon ahadees me se sirf chand hazar ka intikhab kiya. To hadees ki jaanch ka ilm Ilm-e-Rijal hai, aur jaanch ka markaz sanad ke ravi hote hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paper ke fix facts ki recap"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab saari baatain aik jagah dohra lo. Hadees ki tareef me teen hisse hain, qawl, fail aur taqreer, aur taqreer ka matlab hai samne kiye gaye kaam par khamoshi ikhtiyar kar lena. Har hadees ke do hisse hote hain, sanad jo ravioun ki zanjeer hai, aur matan jo asal mazmoon hai. Hadees bayan karne wale ko ravi kehte hain. Hadees-e-Qudsi me maana Allah ki taraf se aur alfaaz Nabi ke hote hain, jabke Hadees-e-Nabawi Nabi ka apna qawl o amal hai, aur Qudsi Quran nahi hai. Sanad ke hisab se kasrat wali yaqeeni hadees Mutawatir hai aur is se kam Ahad. Sihah Sitta chhe kitabein hain, Bukhari, Muslim, Abu Dawood, Tirmizi, Nasa'i aur Ibn Majah. Sahih Bukhari sab se mustanad kitab hai, is ke musannif Imam Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari hain, aur unhon ne takreeban chhe lakh ahadees se intikhab kiya. Sahih Muslim ke musannif Imam Muslim bin Hajjaj hain, aur Bukhari o Muslim ko mila kar Sahihain kehte hain. Hadees ki pehli tadween shuda mashhoor kitab Muwatta Imam Malik hai. Aur hadees ki jaanch ka ilm Ilm-e-Rijal hai. Ye baatain pakki kar lo to hadees ka har sawal tumhare liye asaan ho jayega."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "seerat",
    title: "Seerat-e-Tayyaba",
    subtitle: "Hazoor Pak Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki zindagi, paidaish se wisal tak",
    portion: "islamiat",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("PPSC ke one paper me Islamiat ke hisse me sab se zyada sawal seerat se hi bante hain. Kabhi tareekh pooch li jati hai, kabhi kisi waqie ka saal, kabhi pehle iman lane walon ki tartib. Ye sawal mushkil nahi hote, bas tartib yaad honi chahiye. Jo student seerat ko aik kahani ki tarah parh le, ke pehle kya hua aur us ke baad kya hua, us ke liye ye sawal sab se asaan number ban jate hain. Is liye hum zindagi ko shuru se aakhir tak aik silsile me parhenge. Tareekhain apne aap zehen me beth jayengi, ratne ki zaroorat hi nahi paregi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paidaish aur khandan"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-makkah.jpg", caption: "Map — Makkah, the birthplace"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki paidaish Makkah Mukarrama me hui. Saal 571 AD tha, aur isi saal ko Aam-ul-Feel kaha jata hai, kyunke isi saal Abrahah hathi wala lashkar lekar Kaaba par hamla karne aya tha aur Allah ne usay nakam kar diya tha. Mashhoor tareekh 12 Rabi-ul-Awwal hai, peer ka din tha. Aap ke walid Hazrat Abdullah Aap ki paidaish se pehle hi wafat pa chuke the. Wo tijarati safar se wapas ate hue Madina me bimar hue aur wahi inteqal kar gaye. Yani Aap duniya me yateem tashreef laye. Walida ka naam Hazrat Amina bint Wahb hai, dada Hazrat Abdul Muttalib Quraish ke sardar the, aur khandan Banu Hashim tha, jo Quraish ka sab se moazzaz khandan mana jata tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dai Halima aur bachpan ke pehle saal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Arab ke dastoor ke mutabiq bachon ko dehat bhej diya jata tha taake wo khuli hawa me palen aur saaf zaban seekhen. Aap ko Hazrat Halima Saadia ne raza'at ke liye liya, yani Aap un ke pas doodh peene aur parwarish ke liye rahe. Hazrat Halima bayan karti hain ke is bachay ke ane se un ke ghar me barkat aa gayi. Jab Aap ki umar chhay saal hui to walida Hazrat Amina Aap ko lekar Madina gayin, aur wapsi par Abwa ke maqam par un ka inteqal ho gaya. Ab Aap maa se bhi mehroom ho gaye. Phir dada Hazrat Abdul Muttalib ne kafalat ki, lekin jab Aap aath saal ke hue to dada bhi wafat pa gaye. Us ke baad chacha Abu Talib ne Aap ko apni kafalat me liya, aur ye kafalat zindagi bhar ke rishtay me badal gayi. Abu Talib ne hamesha Aap ki hifazat ki aur Makkah ke mushrikeen ke muqable me Aap ka sath diya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Bachpan aur jawani ke mashhoor waqiat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jab Aap takreeban bara saal ke hue to chacha Abu Talib ke sath Sham ke tijarati safar par gaye. Busra ke maqam par Bahira nami rahib ne Aap ko dekha, nubuwwat ki nishaniyan pehchanein aur Abu Talib ko mashwara diya ke is bachay ki hifazat karna. Ye waqia har Islamiat ki kitab me ata hai aur paper me bhi poocha jata hai. Jawani me Aap ne Harb-e-Fijar me hissa liya, jahan Aap apne chachaon ko teer uthakar dete the. Isi dor me Aap Hilf-ul-Fuzool me shareek hue, jo mazloom ki madad ka aik muahida tha. Ye muahida Abdullah bin Jud'an ke ghar hua tha. Aap nubuwwat ke baad bhi farmaya karte the ke agar mujhe aaj bhi is muahiday ki taraf bulaya jaye to main zaroor jaon ga. Is se pata chalta hai ke insaf aur mazloom ki madad Aap ki fitrat me shuru se thi. Makkah wale Aap ki sachai aur amanatdari ki wajah se Aap ko Al-Sadiq aur Al-Amin ke laqab se pukarte the."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Tijarat aur Hazrat Khadija se shadi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap ne jawani me tijarat ko pesha banaya. Hazrat Khadija bint Khuwaylid Makkah ki moazzaz aur maaldar khatoon thin, jo apna maal doosron ke zariye tijarat par lagati thin. Unho ne Aap ki amanatdari ki shohrat suni to apna maal dekar Sham bheja. Safar bohat kamiyab raha, munafa bhi zyada hua aur un ke ghulam Maysara ne Aap ki sachai aur akhlaq ki itni tareef ki ke Hazrat Khadija ne khud shadi ka paigham bheja. Us waqt Aap ki umar 25 saal thi aur mashhoor riwayat ke mutabiq Hazrat Khadija ki umar 40 saal thi. Ye shadi 25 saal tak qaim rahi. Jab tak Hazrat Khadija zinda rahin, Aap ne doosri shadi nahi ki. Mushkil tareen dinon me Hazrat Khadija Aap ka sab se bara sahara thin. Unho ne apna saara maal deen ki khidmat me laga diya."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Nabuwwat aur pehli wahi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap aksar Makkah se bahar Ghar-e-Hira me ja kar ibadat aur ghor o fikr farmate the. 610 AD me, jab Aap ki umar 40 saal thi, Ramzan ke mahine me Ghar-e-Hira me Hazrat Jibrail tashreef laye aur pehli wahi nazil hui. Ye Surah Al-Alaq ki pehli paanch ayat thin, jin ka pehla lafz Iqra hai, yani parho. Ghabraye hue Aap ghar tashreef laye to Hazrat Khadija ne tasalli di aur apne chacha-zad bhai Warqa bin Nawfal ke pas le gayin, jinho ne kaha ke ye wohi farishta hai jo Hazrat Musa par nazil hota tha. Paper me ye sawal bar bar ata hai ke pehli wahi kahan nazil hui, kis surah ki ayat thin aur us waqt Aap ki umar kya thi. Teeno jawab ab tumhare zehen me hain: Ghar-e-Hira, Surah Al-Alaq, 40 saal."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle iman lane wale"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ye tartib paper ka fix sawal hai, isay kahani ki tarah yaad kar lo. Sab se pehle iman Hazrat Khadija layin, yani auraton me sab se pehle. Azad mardon me sab se pehle Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq iman laye. Bachon me sab se pehle Hazrat Ali iman laye, jin ki umar us waqt das saal ke qareeb thi. Aur ghulamon me sab se pehle Hazrat Zaid bin Harisa iman laye, jo Aap ke azad karda ghulam aur munh bole betay ki haisiyat rakhte the. Is ke baad Hazrat Usman, Hazrat Zubair, Hazrat Talha aur doosre azeem sahaba is karwan me shamil hote gaye. Is pehle giroh ko Assabiqoon-al-Awwaloon kaha jata hai, aur in ka darja Quran me bhi bayan hua hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Khufiya dawat aur Makkah ke mushkil saal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle teen saal dawat khufiya rahi. Aap chhup kar logon ko Allah ki taraf bulate aur namaz parhte the. Phir jab elaaniya dawat ka hukm aya to Aap ne Koh-e-Safa par kharay ho kar poore Makkah ko awaz di. Yahi se mukhalfat shuru ho gayi. Quraish ne pehle lalach diya, sardari aur daulat ki peshkash ki, phir dhamkiyan dein, phir mazalim shuru kar diye. Ghareeb sahaba par sakht tareen zulm hue. Kuch sahaba ko Habsha ki taraf hijrat karna pari. Aik dor wo aya ke Banu Hashim ka teen saal tak social boycott raha, aur ye saal Sheb-e-Abi Talib me guzre jahan khane peene ki sakht takleef thi. Phir aik hi saal me pehle Abu Talib aur phir Hazrat Khadija ka inteqal ho gaya. Ye saal Aam-ul-Huzn, yani gham ka saal, kahlata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Taif ka safar"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-taif.jpg", caption: "Map — Taif"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aam-ul-Huzn ke baad Aap Taif tashreef le gaye taake wahan ke logon ko dawat dein. Taif walo ne na sirf inkar kiya balke sheher ke awara ladkon ko peeche laga diya, jinho ne pathar mar mar kar Aap ko zakhmi kar diya. Hazrat Ayesha ne aik dafa poocha ke kya Aap par Uhud se bhi sakht din aya? Aap ne farmaya, haan, Taif wala din. Lekin itni takleef ke bawajood Aap ne Taif walo ke liye bad-dua nahi ki, balke un ki hidayat ki dua ki. Ye waqia Aap ke sabr aur rehmat ki sab se bari misaal hai, aur paper me aksar poocha jata hai ke Aap ki zindagi ka sab se sakht din konsa tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Isra aur Miraj"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Isi mushkil dor me wo azeem waqia pesh aya jise Miraj kehte hain. Mashhoor tareekh 27 Rajab hai. Aik raat Aap ko Masjid-e-Haram se Masjid-e-Aqsa tak le jaya gaya, is safar ko Isra kehte hain, aur phir wahan se asmanon ki sair karai gayi, jisay Miraj kehte hain. Isi raat ummat ko paanch namazon ka tohfa mila. Pehle pachaas namazain farz hui thin, phir Hazrat Musa ke mashware par takhfeef hoti gayi aur aakhir paanch reh gayin, lekin sawab pachaas ka hi rakha gaya. Paper me teen sawal yahan se bante hain: Miraj kis mahine me hua, tohfa kya mila, aur Masjid-e-Aqsa kahan hai. Rajab, paanch namazain, aur Bait-ul-Muqaddas yani Jerusalem."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hijrat-e-Madina"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Jab Makkah me rehna mumkin na raha to Allah ke hukm se hijrat ka faisla hua. 622 AD me Aap Madina ki taraf rawana hue. Is safar me Hazrat Abu Bakr Aap ke rafeeq the, yani sathi. Quraish ke log peecha kar rahe the, is liye Aap ne teen din Ghar-e-Saur me qayam farmaya, jo Makkah ke qareeb Jabal-e-Saur ki ghaar hai. Hazrat Abu Bakr ke betay Abdullah khabrain late, beti Asma khana pohnchati, aur aakhir teen din ke baad karwan Madina ki taraf chal para. Pehle Quba me chand din qayam hua, jahan Masjid-e-Quba ki buniyad pari, phir Aap Madina munawwara me dakhil hue. Isi hijrat se Islami calendar, yani Hijri saal, ki ibtida hoti hai. Ye baat paper me lazmi poochi jati hai ke Hijri calendar kis waqie se shuru hua."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Madina me pehle kaam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Madina pohanch kar Aap ne jo kaam sab se pehle kiye, wo aik riyasat ki buniyad the. Pehla kaam Masjid-e-Nabawi ki tameer thi, jo sirf ibadat ki jagah nahi thi balke markaz-e-hukumat aur school bhi thi. Doosra kaam azan ki shuruaat thi, jis ke pehle muezzin Hazrat Bilal Habshi hue. Teesra azeem kaam muwakhat tha, yani Aap ne Makkah se ane wale muhajireen aur Madina ke ansar ke darmiyan bhai chara qaim kar diya. Ansar ne apni jaidad aur gharon me muhajireen ko hissa diya. Ye duniya ki tareekh ka anokha waqia hai. Chautha kaam Meesaq-e-Madina tha, Madina ke tamaam qabail, bashamool Yahoodion ke sath aik tehreeri muahida. Isay duniya ka pehla tehreeri dastoor kaha jata hai. In chaar kaamo ke naam aur tartib paper ke liye bohat aham hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhri saal, Hajjat-ul-Wida aur wisal"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Madina ke das saalon me Islam poore Arab me phail gaya. 8 Hijri me Makkah baghair bari jang ke fatah ho gaya, jis ki tafseel ghazwaat wale lesson me ayegi. 10 Hijri me Aap ne zindagi ka aakhri aur akela mukammal Hajj ada farmaya, jisay Hajjat-ul-Wida kehte hain. Arafat ke maidan me Aap ne wo tareekhi khutba diya jis me jan, maal aur izzat ki hurmat, auraton ke huqooq, aur tamaam insanon ki barabari ka elaan tha. Isi Hajj ke doran Surah Al-Maida ki wo ayat nazil hui jis me deen ke mukammal hone ki khabar di gayi. Wapsi ke kuch arsay baad Aap bimar hue aur 12 Rabi-ul-Awwal 11 Hijri, yani 632 AD, ko Madina Munawwara me wisal farmaya. Aap ki tadfeen usi hujre me hui jahan wisal hua tha, yani Hazrat Ayesha ke hujre me, aur yahi jagah aaj Masjid-e-Nabawi me Roza-e-Athar hai. Paper ka mashhoor sawal hai ke Aap ki qabr-e-mubarak kahan hai: Madina me, Hazrat Ayesha ke hujre me."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Azwaj-e-Mutahharat aur aulad"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap ki azwaj ko Ummahat-ul-Momineen, yani momino ki maaen, kaha jata hai. In ke naam tartib se yaad kar lo: Hazrat Khadija, Hazrat Sawda, Hazrat Ayesha, Hazrat Hafsa, Hazrat Zaynab bint Khuzayma, Hazrat Umm-e-Salma, Hazrat Zaynab bint Jahsh, Hazrat Juwayria, Hazrat Umm-e-Habiba, Hazrat Safiyya aur Hazrat Maymuna. Kul tadaad gyara hai. Aap ki aulad me teen betay hue: Hazrat Qasim, jin ki nisbat se Aap ki kunniyat Abul-Qasim hai, Hazrat Abdullah, jinhain Tayyib aur Tahir bhi kaha jata hai, aur Hazrat Ibrahim, jo Hazrat Mariya Qibtiyya se hue. Teeno betay bachpan me hi wafat pa gaye. Betiyan chaar thin: Hazrat Zaynab, Hazrat Ruqayya, Hazrat Umm-e-Kulthum aur Hazrat Fatima. Hazrat Fatima se hi Aap ki nasal aage barhi, aur Hazrat Hasan aur Hazrat Hussain Aap ke nawase hain. Ye naam aur tadaadain paper me bar bar poochi jati hain."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paper ke fix nuktaat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo baatein aik saath dohra lo jo paper me sab se zyada ati hain. Paidaish 571 AD, Aam-ul-Feel, 12 Rabi-ul-Awwal. Dai ka naam Halima Saadia. Shadi 25 saal ki umar me Hazrat Khadija se. Pehli wahi 610 AD me, Ghar-e-Hira me, Surah Al-Alaq ki ayat, umar 40 saal. Pehle musalman: auraton me Khadija, mardon me Abu Bakr, bachon me Ali, ghulamon me Zaid. Khufiya dawat teen saal. Gham ka saal Aam-ul-Huzn. Sab se sakht din Taif wala. Miraj 27 Rajab, tohfa paanch namazain. Hijrat 622 AD, rafeeq Abu Bakr, Ghar-e-Saur me teen din, Hijri calendar ki ibtida yahi se. Madina ke pehle kaam: Masjid-e-Nabawi, azan, muwakhat, Meesaq-e-Madina. Hajjat-ul-Wida 10 Hijri. Wisal 12 Rabi-ul-Awwal 11 Hijri, 632 AD, Madina me."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/seerat-timeline.jpg", caption: "Seerat Timeline — 571 to 632"),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "ghazwaat",
    title: "Ghazwaat",
    subtitle: "Kitne hue, kahan hue, aur har maidan me asal me hua kya tha",
    portion: "islamiat",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye topic kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ghazwaat se one paper me har saal sawal ata hai. Kabhi pooch lete hain ke kul ghazwaat kitne hue, kabhi Badr me tadaad kya thi, kabhi Mu'ta ke teen salar kaun the. Ye sawal un students ke liye mushkil hote hain jo sirf naam aur saal ratte hain, kyunke naam aur saal bhool jate hain. Lekin jo student har jang ko aik kahani ki tarah parh le, ke jang hui kyun, maidan me hua kya, aur khatm kis par hui, us ke liye ye sawal sab se mazay ke ban jate hain. Kahani kabhi nahi bhoolti. Is lesson me hum har bari jang ko bilkul wese hi parhenge, kahani ke andaaz me."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle ghazwa aur sariya ka farq samajh lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Sab se pehle ye farq saaf kar lo, kyunke paper yahi se phansata hai. Jis muhim me Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam khud shareek hue, usay ghazwa kehte hain. Aur jo muhim Aap ne kisi sahabi ko salar bana kar bheji aur khud Madina me rahe, usay sariya kehte hain. Tadaad ki baat ye hai ke mashhoor standard jawab 27 ghazwaat hai. Kuch kitabon me 25 aur kuch me 29 bhi milte hain, kyunke kuch muhaqqaqeen chhoti muhimmon ko ginne ya na ginne me ikhtilaf karte hain, lekin paper ke liye fix jawab 27 hi yaad rakho. Sab se pehla sariya Hazrat Hamza ki sarbarahi me 1 Hijri me bheja gaya tha, aur sab se pehla ghazwa Ghazwa-e-Waddan hai, jisay Abwa bhi kehte hain. Pehli bari aur faisla-kun jang Badr thi, jis ki kahani ab shuru hoti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ghazwa-e-Badr, jang jo sab kuch badal gayi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Wajah kya thi. Hijrat ke dusre saal, 2 Hijri me, khabar ayi ke Abu Sufyan ki sarbarahi me Quraish ka bara tijarati qafila Sham se Makkah ja raha hai, aur is qafile ki kamai musalmano ke khilaf jang par lagni thi. Dusri taraf Quraish bhi Madina par hamlay ki tayyari me the. Aap 313 sahaba ko lekar nikle. Is tadaad ko khaas yaad rakho: 313. In me se aksar ke pas na zira thi na hathiyar, kul do ghoray aur sattar oont the, jin par bari bari sawari hoti thi. Abu Sufyan qafila bacha kar nikal gaya, lekin Makkah se Abu Jahl ki sarbarahi me aik hazar ka lashkar poori tayyari ke sath Madina ki taraf barh aya. Aap ne Badr ke maqam par parhao dala, jahan pani ke kunwein the. Aik sahabi Hazrat Hubab bin Munzir ke mashware par musalmano ne kunwon ke qareeb jagah li taake pani un ke qabze me rahe. Jang se pehle Aap ne poori raat dua me guzari."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Munaasib tareekh 17 Ramzan 2 Hijri hai, aur is din ko Quran ne Yaum-ul-Furqan kaha hai, yani haq aur batil me farq karne wala din. Maidan me pehle mubarizat hui, yani aik aik karke muqabla, phir aam jang shuru ho gayi. Allah ne farishton ki madad bheji. Nateeja ye nikla ke musalmanon ki faisla-kun fatah hui. Musalmano ke 14 sahaba shaheed hue. Quraish ke 70 admi mare gaye aur 70 qaidi bane. Marne walon me Abu Jahl bhi tha, jo is ummat ka Firaun kahlata tha, aur Umayya bin Khalaf bhi. Qaidion ke sath Aap ne aisa sulook kiya ke jo parhe likhe the, un ka fidya ye rakha ke wo das das musalman bachon ko parhna likhna sikha dein. Is jang ne saabit kar diya ke fatah tadaad se nahi, iman aur nazm se milti hai."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-badr.jpg", caption: "Map — Badr, south-west of Madinah"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ghazwa-e-Uhud, jeet-ti hui jang ka rukh kesay badla"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Wajah Badr ki haar ka badla thi. 3 Hijri me Quraish teen hazar ka lashkar lekar aye, jis ki qayadat Abu Sufyan kar raha tha. Is dafa un ki auratain bhi sath thin taake koi maidan se na bhage. Musalmano ki tadaad 700 thi. Aap ne Uhud pahar ko apni pusht par rakha aur aik chhoti pahari par Hazrat Abdullah bin Jubair ki sarbarahi me pachaas teer-andaz bitha diye, aur sakht hukm diya ke chahe kuch ho jaye, ye jagah mat chorna. Jang shuru hui to musalman ghalib aa gaye, dushman bhagne laga. Teer-andazon ne samjha jang khatm ho gayi, aksar ne pahari chor di. Khalid bin Waleed, jo us waqt tak musalman nahi hue the, dushman ke ghudsawar dastay ko lekar usi khali pahari ke peeche se aa gaye aur peeche se hamla kar diya. Jeet-ti hui jang ka rukh palat gaya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is jang me 70 sahaba shaheed hue. Hazrat Hamza, Aap ke chacha aur Sher-e-Khuda kahlane wale, Wahshi nami ghulam ke neze se shaheed hue. Hazrat Mus'ab bin Umair bhi shaheed hue, ye wohi sahabi hain jo hijrat se pehle Madina bheje gaye the aur Islam ke pehle safeer kahlate hain. Aap Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam khud zakhmi hue, dandaan-e-mubarak shaheed hua. Is jang ka sab se bara sabaq ye hai ke salar ka hukm manna hi fatah hai, aur aik chhoti si nafarmani poori jeet ko badal sakti hai. Paper me Uhud se ye sawal fix ate hain: teer-andazon ki tadaad pachaas, un ke salar Abdullah bin Jubair, shuhada sattar, aur Hazrat Hamza ke qatil ka naam Wahshi."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-madinah.jpg", caption: "Map — Madinah, with Uhud in its north"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ghazwa-e-Khandaq, jab khandaq ne das hazar ko rok diya"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("5 Hijri me wo hua jo Arab me pehle kabhi nahi hua tha. Quraish, Ghatafan aur dusre qabail ne mil kar das hazar ka ittehadi lashkar tayyar kiya, is liye isay Ghazwa-e-Ahzab bhi kehte hain, ahzab yani giroh aur ittehad. Musalmano ki tadaad teen hazar ke qareeb thi. Aamne samne ki jang me jeetna mushkil tha. Tab Hazrat Salman Farsi ne aik mashwara diya jo Arab ke liye bilkul naya tha. Unho ne kaha ke Fars me jab dushman zyada ho to sheher ke gird khandaq, yani gehri khaai, khod dete hain. Aap ko mashwara pasand aya. Madina ke teen taraf pahaar aur baghaat the, sirf aik taraf khula maidan tha, wahi khandaq khodi gayi. Aap khud kodali chala kar mitti uthate rahe. Thand, bhook aur musalsal mehnat ke din the."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Dushman aya to samne gehri khaai dekh kar heran reh gaya, ghore aage barh hi nahi sakte the. Takreeban aik maah muhasra raha. Is doran dushman ke mashhoor pehelwan Amr bin Abd Wudd ne khandaq par karke muqabla talab kiya, to Hazrat Ali samne aye aur usay qatal kar diya. Aakhir aik raat sakht aandhi ayi, dushman ke khaimay ukhar gaye, bartanon tak ko ulta kar diya, aur ittehad toot kar wapas chala gaya. Bari jang hue baghair Madina bach gaya. Paper wali khaas baatein: khandaq ka mashwara Salman Farsi ka tha, dushman ki tadaad das hazar, aur ye 5 Hijri ki baat hai."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-madinah.jpg", caption: "Map — Madinah, the trench city"),
      LessonBlock.heading("Banu Qurayza ka muhasra"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Khandaq ke foran baad ka waqia hai, is liye mukhtasar samajh lo. Madina ke andar rehne wale Yahudi qabile Banu Qurayza ne muahida tora aur muhasre ke naazuk waqt me dushman se raabta kiya. Khandaq khatm hote hi Aap ne un ke qile ka muhasra kiya, jo takreeban pachis din raha. Aakhir unho ne khud ye shart manzoor ki ke Hazrat Saad bin Muaz jo faisla karenge wo manzoor hoga, aur unho ne Taurat ke qanoon ke mutabiq faisla diya. Ye waqia is liye aham hai ke paper me aksar poocha jata hai ke Khandaq ke baad konsi muhim hui aur faisla kis sahabi ne kiya tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Sulah Hudaybiyyah, jo sulah asal me fatah thi"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("6 Hijri me Aap 1400 sahaba ke sath Umrah ke irade se Makkah rawana hue. Hathiyar sath nahi the, sirf musafir ki talwar thi. Quraish ne raasta rok diya. Hudaybiyyah ke maqam par parhao hua. Wahan aik darakht ke neeche Aap ne sahaba se ahed liya jisay Bait-e-Rizwan kehte hain. Phir muzakrat hue aur aik sulah-nama likha gaya. Us ki shartein dekhne me musalmano ke khilaf lagti thin: is saal Umrah kiye baghair wapas jana hoga, jang das saal ke liye band rahegi, aur jo shakhs Makkah se bhag kar Madina aye ga usay wapas karna hoga. Kuch sahaba ko ye shartein sakht mehsoos hui. Lekin Allah ne is sulah ko Surah Al-Fath me Fatah-e-Mubeen, yani khuli fatah, qarar diya. Aur waqai aisa hi hua. Jang band hone se aman mila, dawat ka kaam puray Arab me khul kar hone laga, aur agle do saalon me musalmano ki tadaad is se pehle ke poore arse se zyada barh gayi. Paper ka trap yahan ye hai ke Hudaybiyyah koi jang nahi thi, sulah thi, aur tadaad 1400 thi. Aur khaas baat ye ke yehi sulah do saal baad Fatah Makkah ki buniyad bani, kyunke Quraish ne khud isay tora tha."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ghazwa-e-Khaybar, qile jo aik aik karke gire"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("7 Hijri me Aap Khaybar ki taraf gaye. Khaybar Madina ke shimal me Yahoodion ke mazboot qilon ka ilaqa tha, jahan se Madina ke khilaf sazishain hoti rehti thin. Musalmano ki tadaad 1400 ke qareeb thi. Qile aik aik karke fatah hue. Aik mashhoor waqia ye hai ke Aap ne farmaya, kal main alam us shakhs ko dunga jis se Allah aur us ka Rasool mohabbat karte hain. Agle din alam Hazrat Ali ko diya gaya, halanke un ki ankhain dukh rahi thin. Hazrat Ali ne Khaybar ke mashhoor pehelwan Marhab ko muqable me qatal kiya aur qila fatah ho gaya. Nateeje me Khaybar ki paidawar ka aadha hissa musalmano ko milne ka muahida hua. Paper me Khaybar se do sawal fix hain: alam kis ko mila, Hazrat Ali ko, aur Marhab ko kis ne qatal kiya, Hazrat Ali ne."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Fatah Makkah, fatah jis me khoon nahi baha"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-makkah.jpg", caption: "Map — Makkah"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("8 Hijri me Quraish aur un ke ittehadiyon ne Sulah Hudaybiyyah tod di. Aap das hazar ka lashkar lekar Makkah rawana hue. Tadaad phir yaad rakho: das hazar. Itna bara lashkar dekh kar Makkah walo ki himmat jawab de gayi. Abu Sufyan Aap ki khidmat me hazir hua aur musalman ho gaya. Aap ne elaan farmaya ke jo Abu Sufyan ke ghar chala jaye wo mehfooz, jo apna darwaza band kar le wo mehfooz, jo Masjid-e-Haram me chala jaye wo mehfooz. Sheher takreeban baghair jang ke fatah ho gaya. Phir wo lamha aya jis ka duniya intezar karti thi. Wahi Quraish samne the jinho ne Aap ko aur sahaba ko barson sataya tha, aur badla lena Aap ke ikhtiyar me tha. Lekin Aap ne aam maafi ka elaan kar diya aur farmaya, aaj tum par koi ilzam nahi. Kaaba ko buton se paak kiya gaya. Ye duniya ki tareekh ki wo fatah hai jis me fateh ne badle ki bajaye maafi di. Isi liye Fatah Makkah ka sawal har paper me ata hai: 8 Hijri, Ramzan ka mahina, tadaad das hazar, aur aam maafi."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ghazwa-e-Hunayn, jab tadaad par fakhar mehnga para"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Fatah Makkah ke foran baad, 8 Hijri me hi, Hawazin aur Saqeef qabail bara lashkar lekar Wadi-e-Hunayn me jama hue. Musalmano ki tadaad is dafa bara hazar thi, sab se zyada. Kuch logon ke munh se nikal gaya ke aaj hamein kaun hara sakta hai. Subah ke dhundalke me dushman ne pahari darron se achanak teeron ki barish kar di. Musalman muntashir ho gaye, safain toot gayin. Us naazuk waqt me Aap apni jagah sabit qadam rahe aur buland awaz se pukara ke main Allah ka Rasool hun, ye jhoot nahi. Hazrat Abbas ki awaz par sahaba lotne lage, safain dobara bandhin, aur phir poori taqat se hamla hua to dushman ko shikast hui. Is jang ka sabaq Quran ne bhi bayan kiya ke Hunayn ke din tumhari kasrat ne tumhe maghroor kar diya tha, lekin wo kaam na ayi. Paper me Hunayn se yehi sabaq aur Fatah Makkah ke baad hone wali jang ka naam poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Taif ka muhasra"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-taif.jpg", caption: "Map — Taif, south-east of Makkah"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hunayn ke baad Aap Taif gaye, jahan Banu Saqeef qila-band ho gaye the. Ye wohi Taif hai jahan barson pehle Aap ko pathar mare gaye the. Muhasra takreeban bees din raha, lekin qila mazboot tha aur andar khana peena mojood tha. Aap ne muhasra utha liya aur Taif walo ke liye hidayat ki dua ki. Nateeja ye hua ke kuch arse baad Taif ka wafd khud Madina aya aur musalman ho gaya. Ye waqia sikhata hai ke har muamla talwar se nahi hota, kuch dil waqt se jeete jate hain. Paper me ye mukhtasar sawal banta hai ke Hunayn ke baad konsi muhim hui: Taif."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ghazwa-e-Tabuk, aakhri ghazwa jahan jang hui hi nahi"),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-tabuk.jpg", caption: "Map — Tabuk, the last expedition"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("9 Hijri me khabar ayi ke Room ki saltanat, yani Byzantine Empire, Sham ki sarhad par bara lashkar jama kar rahi hai. Mausam sakht garmi ka tha, faslain pak chuki thin, safar lamba tha. Aap ne tees hazar ka lashkar tayyar kiya, jo us waqt tak ka sab se bara Islami lashkar tha. Isay Jaysh-ul-Usra, yani tangi ka lashkar, kaha jata hai, kyunke sawari aur kharch ki sakht kami thi. Sahaba ne dil khol kar maal diya: Hazrat Usman ne bohat bara hissa diya, Hazrat Abu Bakr apna saara maal le aye, Hazrat Umar aadha le aye. Lashkar Tabuk tak gaya, wahan takreeban bees din qayam raha, lekin Roomi lashkar muqable par aya hi nahi. Baghair jang ke wapas aye, lekin is safar ne munafiqeen ko benaqab kar diya aur Arab ke shimali ilaqon me Islam ka roab qaim ho gaya. Paper ki khaas baat: Tabuk Aap ka aakhri ghazwa hai, tadaad tees hazar, aur yahan koi jang nahi hui thi. Ye teenon baatein aik saath yaad kar lo."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Jang-e-Mu'ta, sariya jo ghazwa se zyada mashhoor hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo waqia jo paper ka sab se pyara trap hai. 8 Hijri me Aap ne apne safeer ko Busra ke hukmaran ki taraf bheja, jise raaste me qatal kar diya gaya. Safeer ka qatal us dor me jang ka elaan samjha jata tha. Aap ne teen hazar ka lashkar tayyar kiya aur use Mu'ta ki taraf bheja, jo aaj ke Jordan me hai. Lekin khaas baat suno: is muhim me Aap khud shareek nahi hue, is liye ye ghazwa nahi, sariya hai. Wahan dushman ki tadaad musalmano se kahin zyada thi, riwayat me aik lakh ke qareeb bayan hoti hai. Aap ne pehle se teen salar tartib se muqarrar kar diye the: pehle Hazrat Zaid bin Harisa, wo shaheed hon to Hazrat Jafar bin Abi Talib, wo shaheed hon to Hazrat Abdullah bin Rawaha. Maidan me teeno isi tartib se shaheed hue. Hazrat Jafar ke dono bazu kat gaye, is liye unhain Jafar-e-Tayyar aur Zul-Janahain, yani do paron wala, kaha jata hai, kyunke Allah ne unhain jannat me do par ata farmaye. Teeno salar shaheed hue to lashkar ne alam Hazrat Khalid bin Waleed ko diya. Unho ne aisi hikmat se lashkar ko ladhaya aur mehfooz wapas nikala ke Aap ne unhain Saifullah, yani Allah ki talwar, ka laqab diya. Ye tartib, teeno salar ke naam aur un ki shahadat ka silsila, paper me lazmi poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Saal-war tartib, aakhir me aik nazar"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab poori kahani ko saalon ki tartib me dohra lo. 2 Hijri me Badr hua, pehli faisla-kun fatah. 3 Hijri me Uhud hua, jahan nafarmani ka sabaq mila. 4 Hijri me Banu Nazeer ki muhim hui. 5 Hijri me Khandaq aur us ke baad Banu Qurayza hue. 6 Hijri me Sulah Hudaybiyyah hui, jo jang nahi sulah thi. 7 Hijri me Khaybar fatah hua. 8 Hijri sab se masroof saal tha: Mu'ta ka sariya, phir Fatah Makkah, phir Hunayn aur Taif. 9 Hijri me Tabuk hua, jo aakhri ghazwa tha. 10 Hijri ke baad koi ghazwa nahi hua, kyunke Arab ka aksar hissa Islam ke saaye me aa chuka tha. Kul mashhoor tadaad 27 ghazwaat hai, jin me se in baron ki kahani tum ne parh li. Agar paper me sirf ye tartib aur har jang ki aik khaas baat yaad ho, to ghazwaat ke taqreeban saare sawal hal ho jate hain."),
      LessonBlock.image("assets/learning/diagrams/history/ghazwa-madinah.jpg", caption: "Map — Madinah at the centre"),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "khulafa-sahaba",
    title: "Khulafa-e-Rashideen aur Mashhoor Sahaba",
    subtitle: "Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke baad ke sab se bare naam, aur paper ke fix sawal",
    portion: "islamiat",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye lesson kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("PPSC ke one paper me Islamiat ka hissa kabhi khali nahi jata, aur us hisse me Khulafa-e-Rashideen aur Sahaba par sawal lagbhag pakka hota hai. Kabhi poocha jata hai ke pehle khalifa kaun the, kabhi ye ke Zun-Noorain kis ka laqab hai, kabhi ye ke sab se zyada hadees kis sahabi se riwayat hain. Ye sawal mushkil nahi hote, bas naam, laqab aur karnaama teeno ko jor kar yaad karna hota hai. Is lesson me hum chaaron Khulafa ko tartib se parhen ge, phir un das sahaba ko jinhe duniya me jannat ki basharat mili, aur phir un mashhoor sahaba ko jin par paper baar baar sawal banata hai. Aik baat pehle din se zehen me bitha lo. Khilafat ki tartib wahi hai jo ummat ki tareekh me rahi: pehle Hazrat Abu Bakr, phir Hazrat Umar, phir Hazrat Usman, phir Hazrat Ali, Radi Allahu Anhum ajmaeen. Tartib ulta karna paper ki sab se purani ghalti hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehle ye samajh lo, khalifa kehte kis ko hain"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke wisaal ke baad ummat ki rehnumai ke liye jo shakhs muntakhab hua use khalifa kehte hain. Khalifa ka kaam deen ki hifazat, ummat ki rehnumai aur riyasat ka intezam tha. Pehle chaar khulafa ko Khulafa-e-Rashideen kaha jata hai, kyunke unhon ne Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke tareeqe par khilafat chalai. Rashideen ka matlab hai hidayat yafta. In chaaron ka majmooi dor takreeban tees saal banta hai, aur ye tees saal ka number bhi paper me poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddique Radi Allahu Anhu"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddique ummat ke pehle khalifa hain. Aap ka asal naam Abdullah tha, Abu Bakr kunniyat thi, aur Siddique aur Ateeq aap ke mashhoor laqab hain. Siddique ka matlab hai bohat zyada sach bolne wala aur har baat ki tasdeeq karne wala. Jab Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne waaqia-e-Miraj bayan farmaya to kafiron ne mazaaq uraya, lekin Hazrat Abu Bakr ne bila jhijhak kaha ke agar Aap ne farmaya hai to sach farmaya hai. Isi tasdeeq par aap ko Siddique ka laqab mila. Ateeq ka matlab hai azad karda, aur ye laqab bhi aap ko Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki zubaani ata hua. Hijrat ke safar me aap hi Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke rafeeq the, Ghar-e-Saur me teeno din aap sath rahe, aur Quran ne aap ko saaniya isnain, yani do me se dusra, keh kar zikr kiya. Aap Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke sasur bhi the, Hazrat Ayesha Radi Allahu Anha aap ki beti hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap ki muddat-e-khilafat sirf do saal teen maah hai, ye Khulafa-e-Rashideen me sab se kam muddat hai, lekin kaam ke hisaab se ye dor bohat bhaari hai. Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke wisaal ke baad Arab me bohat se qabail murtad ho gaye, kuch ne jhoote nabiyon ka sath diya aur kuch ne zakat dene se inkar kar diya. Hazrat Abu Bakr ne poori sakhti aur hikmat se in fitnon ka muqabla kiya. Aap ka mashhoor jumla hai ke agar log aik rassi ke barabar bhi zakat roken ge to main un se jang karunga. Ye jangain tareekh me Hurub-e-Ridda ke naam se mashhoor hain. Dusra bara faisla Hazrat Usama ke lashkar ki rawanagi tha. Ye lashkar Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne apni zindagi me tayyar kiya tha lekin rawana na ho saka tha. Haalaat bohat nazuk the, sahaba ne mashwara diya ke lashkar rok liya jaye, lekin Hazrat Abu Bakr ne farmaya ke jo lashkar Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne bandha hai use Abu Bakr nahi khole ga, aur lashkar rawana kar diya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap ka sab se bara karnaama Quran Majid ki pehli jama hai. Jang-e-Yamama me bohat se huffaz sahaba shaheed ho gaye to Hazrat Umar ke mashware par aap ne Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit ki sarbarahi me Quran ko aik jagah jama karwaya. Us waqt Quran mukammal taur par mukhtalif sahaba ke paas mehfooz tha, lekin aik musalsal nuskhe ki surat me pehli dafa isi dor me murattab hua, aur ye nuskha Hazrat Abu Bakr ke paas raha, phir Hazrat Umar aur phir Hazrat Hafsa Radi Allahu Anha ke paas mehfooz raha. Isi liye Hazrat Abu Bakr ko Jami-e-Quran bhi kaha jata hai. Aap ka wisaal 13 Hijri me hua aur aap Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke pehlu me, Hujra-e-Ayesha me madfoon hain. Paper wale fix facts ye hain: pehle khalifa, muddat do saal teen maah, laqab Siddique aur Ateeq, Usama ke lashkar ki rawanagi, murtadeen aur zakat se inkar karne walon ke khilaf jang, aur Quran ki pehli jama."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hazrat Umar Farooq Radi Allahu Anhu"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Umar Farooq dusre khalifa hain aur aap ki muddat-e-khilafat dus saal hai. Farooq aap ka laqab hai, jis ka matlab hai haq aur baatil me farq karne wala. Ye laqab aap ko Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne ata farmaya tha. Aap ke Islam laane se musalmanon ko khule aam ibadat ki himmat mili, is liye aap ke Islam ko tareekh me aik mod mana jata hai. Ameer-ul-Momineen ka laqab sab se pehle Hazrat Umar ke liye istemal hua. Aap se pehle khalifa ko Khalifat-ur-Rasool kaha jata tha, lekin aap ke dor me ye laqab riwaj ban gaya aur baad ke tamam khulafa ke liye yahi istemal hota raha. Ye point paper me aksar poocha jata hai, isay khaas yaad rakho."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap ka dor futoohat aur intezam ka dor hai. Aap ke zamane me Sham, Iraq, Faras aur Misr fatah hue. Bait-ul-Maqdis yani Yaroshalem bhi aap ke dor me fatah hua aur aap khud wahan tashreef le gaye. Jang-e-Yarmook me Roomi taaqat ka zor toota aur Jang-e-Qadisiyya me Faras ki hukumat khatam hui. Lekin Hazrat Umar ki asal pehchan sirf futoohat nahi, intezam hai. Aap ne adalati nizam qayam kiya aur shehron me qaazi muqarrar kiye. Bait-ul-Maal ko baqaida mehfooz khazane ki surat di aur us ka hisaab kitab rakha gaya. Fauj ke liye daftar aur tankhwahon ka nizam banaya, nayi aabadiyon me Basra aur Kufa jaise sheher abad kiye, nahrain khudwayen, police ka shoba banaya aur logon ki shikayat sunne ka baqaida intezam kiya. Ramzan me taraweeh ko baqaida jamaat ke sath parhne ka riwaj bhi aap ke dor me qayam hua."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hijri calendar ka point paper ka pasandeeda hai aur yahi wo jagah hai jahan aksar students phisalte hain. Baat yun hai ke Hijri saal ki buniyad Hazrat Umar ke dor me rakhi gayi, taake sarkari kagazaat aur tareekhon ka hisaab theek rahe. Saal ka aaghaz kis waaqiye se ho, is par sahaba se mashwara hua, aur Hazrat Ali Radi Allahu Anhu ke mashware par ye tay paya ke saal ka aaghaz Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki Hijrat se ho, aur pehla maheena Muharram rakha gaya. To jawab yun yaad karo: calendar Hazrat Umar ke dor ki yadgaar hai, aur us ke aaghaz ka mashwara Hazrat Ali ka tha. Aap 23 Hijri me aik ghulam Abu Lulu ke hamle se zakhmi hue aur shaheed ho gaye. Aap bhi Hujra-e-Ayesha me Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam aur Hazrat Abu Bakr ke pehlu me madfoon hain. Paper wale fix facts: dusre khalifa, muddat dus saal, laqab Farooq, Ameer-ul-Momineen ka laqab sab se pehle aap ke liye, Sham Faras aur Misr ki futoohat, Hijri calendar ki buniyad, adalati nizam aur Bait-ul-Maal ki tarteeb."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hazrat Usman Ghani Radi Allahu Anhu"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Usman Ghani teesre khalifa hain aur aap ki muddat-e-khilafat baarah saal hai. Aap ko Zun-Noorain kaha jata hai, jis ka matlab hai do noor wala. Is laqab ki wajah bohat khoobsurat hai. Aap ke nikah me pehle Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki sahibzadi Hazrat Ruqayya Radi Allahu Anha aayen, aur un ke wisaal ke baad dusri sahibzadi Hazrat Umm-e-Kulsoom Radi Allahu Anha aap ke nikah me aayen. Yani aik ke baad dusri, Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki do betiyan aap ke nikah me rahen, isi nisbat se aap do noor wale kahlaye. Ye wajah paper me sawal ban kar ati hai, sirf laqab ratna kafi nahi, wajah bhi yaad rakho. Ghani ka laqab aap ki sakhawat ki wajah se hai. Jang-e-Tabook ke liye aap ne itna maal diya ke Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam khush ho gaye. Madina me jab meethe pani ki qillat thi to aap ne Beer-e-Ruma ka kuan khareed kar musalmanon ke liye waqf kar diya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aap ka sab se bara karnaama Quran Majid ka standard nuskha hai. Baat ye thi ke jab Islam door daraz ke ilaaqon tak phaila to mukhtalif ilaaqon me Quran ki qiraat me mamuli farq mehsoos hone laga. Hazrat Huzaifa bin Yaman ne is khatre ki taraf tawajjo dilai. Hazrat Usman ne Hazrat Hafsa ke paas mehfooz asal nuskhe ko mangwa kar Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit ki sarbarahi me aik committee se us ki baqaida naqlein tayyar karwayen, aur ye standard nuskhe tamam bare shehron me bhej diye gaye taake poori ummat aik hi nuskhe par muttafiq rahe. Ye nuskha Nuskha-e-Usmani ke naam se mashhoor hai, aur aaj duniya bhar me jo Quran parha jata hai wahi nuskha hai. Isi khidmat ki wajah se Hazrat Usman ko bhi Jami-e-Quran kaha jata hai. Farq yun yaad karo: Hazrat Abu Bakr ke dor me Quran pehli dafa aik jagah jama hua, Hazrat Usman ke dor me us ka aik standard nuskha poori ummat ke liye tayyar hua. Aap ke dor me Islam ki pehli baqaida bahri fouj yani samandari bera tayyar hua, jis ne Qubrus (Cyprus) ko fatah kiya. Ye Islami tareekh ki pehli navy hai, ye point bhi paper me ata hai. Aap 35 Hijri me shaheed hue, aur aap ki shahadat ke waqt aap Quran ki tilawat farma rahe the. Paper wale fix facts: teesre khalifa, muddat baarah saal, laqab Zun-Noorain aur Ghani, Quran ka standard nuskha, pehli bahri fouj, Beer-e-Ruma ki waqf."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Hazrat Ali Radi Allahu Anhu"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Ali chauthe khalifa hain. Aap Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke chacha zaad bhai bhi hain aur damad bhi, kyunke aap ka nikah Khatoon-e-Jannat Hazrat Fatima Radi Allahu Anha se hua. Bacchon me sab se pehle Islam aap hi ne qabool kiya. Hijrat ki raat aap Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke bistar par lete taake dushman dhoka khaye, ye waaqia aap ki jaan nisari ki sab se bari misaal hai. Aap apni bahaduri ki wajah se Asadullah, yani Allah ke sher, aur Haider ke laqab se mashhoor hain. Jang-e-Khaibar me aap ke haathon qila fatah hua aur Marhab ka muqabla tareekh ka mashhoor waaqia hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ilm me aap ka darja bohat buland hai. Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka mashhoor farmaan hai ke main ilm ka sheher hun aur Ali us ka darwaza hai. Isi liye aap ko Bab-ul-Ilm kaha jata hai. Aap ke khutbaat aur aqwaal ka majmua Nahj-ul-Balagha ke naam se mashhoor hai. Aap ke dor me dar-ul-hukumat Madina se Kufa muntaqil hua, ye point paper me poocha jata hai. Aap ke dor me do bari jangain huin, Jang-e-Jamal aur Jang-e-Siffin, jo musalmanon ke darmiyan pesh aayen aur tareekh ka hissa hain. Aap 40 Hijri me Ramzan ke maheene me Kufa ki masjid me namaz ke liye jate hue hamle me zakhmi hue aur shaheed ho gaye. Paper wale fix facts: chauthe khalifa, dar-ul-hukumat Kufa, Bab-ul-Ilm ka darja, Khatoon-e-Jannat ke shohar, Khaibar ki fatah me kardaar, shahadat 40 Hijri."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ashra Mubashara, jannat ki basharat wale das sahaba"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo das naam yaad kar lo jin par paper me seedha sawal ata hai ke Ashra Mubashara kin ko kehte hain. Ashra ka matlab hai das aur Mubashara ka matlab hai basharat diye gaye. Ye wo das sahaba hain jin ko Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne duniya hi me jannat ki basharat di. In ke naam tartib se yun yaad karo, pehle chaar to wahi Khulafa-e-Rashideen hain. Pehle Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddique, jo ummat ke pehle khalifa hain. Dusre Hazrat Umar Farooq, jo dusre khalifa hain. Teesre Hazrat Usman Ghani, jo Zun-Noorain hain. Chauthe Hazrat Ali, jo Bab-ul-Ilm hain. Panchwen Hazrat Talha bin Ubaidullah, jo Jang-e-Uhud me Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki hifazat me shadeed zakhmi hue the. Chhatay Hazrat Zubair bin Awwam, jo Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke phuphi zaad bhai aur Hawari-e-Rasool ke laqab se mashhoor hain. Saatwen Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Auf, jo Madina ke bare taajiron me se the aur apni sakhawat me mashhoor hain. Aathwen Hazrat Saad bin Abi Waqqas, jo Uhud ke mashhoor teer andaz aur Qadisiyya ke salar hain. Nawen Hazrat Saeed bin Zaid, jo ibtedai musalmanon me se hain. Daswen Hazrat Abu Ubaidah bin Jarrah, jin ko Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne is ummat ka ameen farmaya tha. Aik aasan trick ye hai ke pehle chaar khulafa yaad kar lo, baqi chhe naam Talha, Zubair, Abdur Rahman, Saad, Saeed aur Abu Ubaidah ki surat me aik saans me dohraya karo, das pure ho jayenge."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Mashhoor sahaba jin par paper sawal banata hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab un sahaba ko aik aik karke parh lo jin ki koi na koi khaas pehchan paper ka sawal banti hai. Har sahabi ke sath us ki pehchan wali baat jor kar yaad karna, sirf naam ratne se number nahi milta."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Hamza Radi Allahu Anhu Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke chacha hain aur aap ko Syed-ush-Shuhada, yani shaheedon ke sardar, ka laqab mila. Aap apni taaqat aur bahaduri me poore Makkah me mashhoor the. Jang-e-Badar me aap ne numaya kardaar ada kiya, aur Jang-e-Uhud me aap shaheed hue. Paper me aap ka laqab Syed-ush-Shuhada sab se zyada poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Khalid bin Waleed Radi Allahu Anhu ko Saifullah, yani Allah ki talwaar, ka laqab khud Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne ata farmaya tha. Ye waaqia Jang-e-Mauta ka hai, jahan teeno muqarrar salar yakay baad deegre shaheed ho gaye to Hazrat Khalid ne kamaan sambhali aur fouj ko mehfooz nikala. Aap tareekh ke un salaron me se hain jin hon ne apni zindagi me kisi jang me shikast nahi khayi. Aap ne Khulafa ke dor me Sham aur Iraq ki futoohat me markazi kardaar ada kiya, aur Jang-e-Yarmook aap ki sab se mashhoor fatah hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Saad bin Abi Waqqas Radi Allahu Anhu Ashra Mubashara me bhi shamil hain. Jang-e-Uhud me aap Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke qareeb khare ho kar teer chalate rahe aur Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam aap ko teer dete jate aur farmate jate ke chalao, mere maa baap tum par qurbaan. Ye jumla aap ki sab se bari pehchan hai. Baad me aap Jang-e-Qadisiyya me musalmanon ke sipah salar the, jis me Faras ki taaqat ka khatma hua."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Bilal Habshi Radi Allahu Anhu Islam ke pehle muezzin hain. Aap Habash se talluq rakhne wale ghulam the, Islam laane par aap ko shadeed takleefain di gayen lekin aap Ahad Ahad kehte rahe. Hazrat Abu Bakr ne aap ko khareed kar azad karwaya. Madina me jab azan ka nizam bana to pehli azan aap hi ne di, aur Fatah-e-Makkah ke din Kaaba ki chhat par azan dene ka sharaf bhi aap hi ko mila."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Salman Farsi Radi Allahu Anhu ka talluq Faras yani Iran se tha. Aap haq ki talash me lamba safar karke Madina pahunche aur Islam qabool kiya. Jang-e-Khandaq ke mauqe par Madina ke gird khandaq khodne ka mashwara aap hi ne diya tha, kyunke Faras me dafai jang ka ye tareeqa mashhoor tha. Isi mashware par jang ka naam hi Khandaq par gaya. Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne aap ko apne ahl-e-bait me se qarar diya."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Abu Huraira Radi Allahu Anhu sab se zyada hadees riwayat karne wale sahabi hain. Aap se riwayat karda ahadees ki mashhoor tadaad 5374 hai, ye number paper me jyon ka tyon poocha jata hai is liye gin kar yaad rakho, panch hazar teen so chauhatar. Aap ka asal naam Abdur Rahman bin Sakhr hai. Abu Huraira kunniyat ki wajah ye mashhoor hai ke aap aik billi ke bacche se bohat pyaar karte the aur use sath rakhte the, Huraira ka matlab hai chhoti billi. Aap Suffa ke ashab me se the aur apna tamam waqt Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki sohbat aur hadees ki hifazat ke liye waqf kar diya tha."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit Radi Allahu Anhu katib-e-wahy the, yani jab Quran nazil hota to use likhne walon me aap sar-e-fahrist the. Hazrat Abu Bakr ke dor me jab Quran ko aik jagah jama karne ka faisla hua to is azeem kaam ki zimmedari aap hi ko di gayi, aur Hazrat Usman ke dor me standard nuskha tayyar karne wali committee ki sarbarahi bhi aap hi ne ki. To jab bhi sawal aye ke Quran ki jama ki zimmedari kis ko mili, jawab Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Jafar Tayyar Radi Allahu Anhu Hazrat Ali ke bare bhai hain. Aap ne Habsha ki taraf hijrat ki aur wahan ke badshah Najashi ke darbar me musalmanon ki taraf se wo mashhoor taqreer ki jo tareekh ka hissa ban gayi. Jang-e-Mauta me aap shaheed hue. Aap ne pehle aik haath se alam pakra, wo kata to dusre se, wo bhi kata to baazuon se alam ko girne na diya. Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya ke Allah ne aap ko un haathon ke badle jannat me do par ata farmaye hain jin se aap farishton ke sath urte hain. Isi liye aap Tayyar aur Zul-Janahain, yani do paron wala, ke laqab se mashhoor hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Ayesha Radi Allahu Anha Umm-ul-Momineen hain, yani momineen ki maa, aur ye darja tamam Azwaj-e-Mutahharat ko hasil hai. Aap Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddique ki sahibzadi hain. Aap se bohat badi tadaad me ahadees riwayat hain aur bare bare sahaba deeni masail me aap se rujoo karte the. Ilm-e-deen ki ashayaat me aap ka maqam bohat buland hai, is liye paper me aap hadees aur fiqh ki riwayat ke hawale se poochi jati hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hazrat Fatima Radi Allahu Anha Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki sab se chhoti aur sab se pyari sahibzadi hain, Khatoon-e-Jannat aap ka mashhoor khitaab hai. Aap ka nikah Hazrat Ali se hua aur Hazrat Hasan aur Hazrat Husain Radi Allahu Anhuma aap hi ke sahibzade hain. Aap ki zindagi saadgi, sabr aur ibadat ki misaal hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Aakhir me dohra lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab poore lesson ko aik saans me dohra lo taake paper wale din kuch na bhoole. Khulafa ki tartib Abu Bakr, Umar, Usman, Ali hai. Muddatain do saal teen maah, dus saal, baarah saal, aur Hazrat Ali ka dor un ke baad. Laqab yun joro: Siddique aur Ateeq Abu Bakr ke, Farooq aur Ameer-ul-Momineen Umar ke, Zun-Noorain aur Ghani Usman ke, Asadullah aur Bab-ul-Ilm Ali ke. Karnaame yun joro: Quran ki pehli jama aur Usama ka lashkar Abu Bakr se, Hijri calendar aur adalati nizam Umar se, standard nuskha aur pehli bahri fouj Usman se, Kufa dar-ul-hukumat Ali se. Ashra Mubashara me chaar khulafa ke ilawa Talha, Zubair, Abdur Rahman bin Auf, Saad bin Abi Waqqas, Saeed bin Zaid aur Abu Ubaidah hain. Aur pehchan wale sahaba: Syed-ush-Shuhada Hamza, Saifullah Khalid, Qadisiyya ke salar Saad, pehle muezzin Bilal, Khandaq ka mashwara Salman ka, sab se zyada hadees 5374 Abu Huraira se, jama-e-Quran ki zimmedari Zaid bin Sabit ki, aur do paron wala laqab Jafar Tayyar ka. Ye jor agar pakke ho jayen to Islamiat ke is hisse ka koi sawal tum se nahi nikle ga."),
    ],
  ),
  GeoTopic(
    id: "arkan-iman",
    title: "Arkan-e-Islam aur Iman ki Buniyadein",
    subtitle: "Paanch satoon jin par Islam khara hai, aur chhe baatein jin par iman mukammal hota hai",
    portion: "islamiat",
    blocks: <LessonBlock>[
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye lesson kyun zaroori hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("PPSC ke one paper me Islamiat ke sab se pehle aur sab se zyada dohraye jane wale sawal yahin se bante hain. Islam ke arkan kitne hain, namaz kab farz hui, zakat ka nisab kitna hai, Hajj kab farz hua, iman ke arkan kaun se hain, Taurat kis par nazil hui, soor phoonkne wala farishta kaun hai. Ye sawal har paper me ghum phir kar ate hain aur ye number sab se asaan hote hain, bas sharte ye hai ke har baat apni jagah par pakki ho. Aik mashhoor hadees me Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne farmaya ke Islam ki buniyad paanch cheezon par hai. Unhi paanch ko arkan-e-Islam kehte hain. Aur aik dusri mashhoor hadees, jo Hadees-e-Jibrail ke naam se mashhoor hai, us me iman ki chhe buniyadein bayan hui hain. Is lesson me pehle paanch arkan tafseel se parhen ge, phir iman ke chhe arkan, phir asmani kitabein aur mashhoor farishte. Tartib hamesha yahi rahe gi: Shahadat, Namaz, Roza, Zakat, Hajj. Is tartib ko aik saans me dohrane ki aadat daal lo, paper me arkan ki tartib hi aksar sawal ban jati hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Pehla rukn, Shahadat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Islam ka pehla rukn Shahadat hai, yani gawahi dena. Is ka matlab hai dil se manna aur zubaan se iqrar karna ke Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi aur Hazrat Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam Allah ke aakhri rasool hain. Isi gawahi ko Kalma-e-Tayyaba kaha jata hai, La ilaha illallah Muhammad-ur-Rasoolullah. Ye Islam ka darwaza hai, jo shakhs ye kalma sachhe dil se parh le wo Islam me dakhil ho jata hai. Baqi chaaron arkan isi buniyad par khare hain, is liye Shahadat hamesha pehle number par ati hai. Paper me sawal yun banta hai ke Islam ka pehla rukn kaun sa hai, ya Kalma-e-Tayyaba ko kya kehte hain. Dono ka jawab tumhe ab maloom hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Dusra rukn, Namaz"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Islam ka dusra rukn Namaz hai. Namaz Allah se seedha rabta hai aur ye wo wahid rukn hai jo Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko Miraj ki raat ata hua. Waaqia yun hai ke Miraj ke mauqe par pehle pachas namazain farz huin, phir Hazrat Musa Alaihis Salam ke mashware par Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam baar baar arz karte rahe aur aakhir me paanch namazain reh gayen, lekin sawab pachas hi ka rakha gaya. Isi liye kaha jata hai ke namaz momineen ke liye Miraj ka tohfa hai. Namaz Hijrat se pehle, Miraj ke mauqe par farz hui, ye point paper me tareekh ke sath poocha jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Din me paanch waqt ki namaz farz hai aur un ke naam tartib se yun hain: pehli Fajar, jo subah sadiq se sooraj nikalne se pehle tak parhi jati hai. Dusri Zohar, jo dopahar ko zawaal ke baad parhi jati hai. Teesri Asar, jo soraj dhalne ke baad maghrib se pehle hai. Chauthi Maghrib, jo sooraj ghuroob hote hi parhi jati hai. Panchwin Isha, jo raat ko shafaq ghayab hone ke baad parhi jati hai. In paanchon ke naam aur tartib dono paper me ate hain. Chand aur baatein bhi jor kar yaad kar lo. Wuzu namaz ki kunji hai, baghair wuzu namaz nahi hoti. Azan ka nizam Madina Munawwara me Hijrat ke baad pehle saal qayam hua, aur pehli azan dene wale Hazrat Bilal Habshi Radi Allahu Anhu hain. Jummah ki namaz Zohar ki jagah jamaat ke sath parhi jati hai aur ye har aqil baligh mard par farz hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Teesra rukn, Roza"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Islam ka teesra rukn Roza hai. Roza Ramzan ke maheene me rakha jata hai, subah sadiq se ghuroob-e-aftab tak khane peene aur nafsani khwahishat se ruke rehne ka naam roza hai. Roza 2 Hijri me farz hua, ye tareekh paper ka fix sawal hai, isay Ramzan ki farziyat ke sath jor kar yaad karo. Roze ka asal maqsad Quran ne taqwa bayan kiya hai, yani Allah ka khauf aur parhezgari paida karna. Bhooka rehna asal maqsad nahi, asal maqsad nafs ko qaabu me karna hai. Ramzan hi wo maheena hai jis me Quran Majid ka nuzool shuru hua, aur isi maheene me Laylat-ul-Qadr hai jo hazar maheenon se behtar raat hai aur Ramzan ke aakhri ashray ki taaq raaton me talash ki jati hai. Ramzan ke baad pehli Shawwal ko Eid-ul-Fitr manayi jati hai, jo roza daron ke liye Allah ki taraf se inaam ka din hai. Eid se pehle Sadqa-e-Fitr ada karna wajib hota hai taake ghareeb bhi Eid ki khushi me shamil ho saken."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chautha rukn, Zakat"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Islam ka chautha rukn Zakat hai. Zakat ka matlab hai paak karna aur barhna. Shariat ki istilah me is ka matlab hai ke jo musalman sahib-e-nisab ho wo apne maal ka aik makhsoos hissa, jo aam tor par dhai feesad hota hai, saal guzarne par mustahiq logon ko de. Zakat maal ko paak karti hai aur muashre me ghareeb ki madad ka sab se bara nizam hai. Ab nisab ko samajh lo, kyunke paper me nisab ke number hi pooche jate hain. Nisab us kam az kam maal ko kehte hain jis par zakat farz hoti hai. Sone ka nisab saarhe saat tola hai, yani saatsath gram se kuch zyada, standard hisaab me 87.48 gram mashhoor hai. Chandi ka nisab saarhe baawan tola hai, yani 612.36 gram. Naqad raqam, tijarti samaan aur sone chandi par zakat ki sharah dhai feesad hai, yani chaaleeswan hissa. Ye teen number, saat saat saat tola nahi, saarhe saat tola sona, saarhe baawan tola chandi, aur dhai feesad sharah, inhe alag alag gin kar yaad rakho kyunke options me aksar yehi number idhar udhar karke phansaya jata hai. Kheti ki paidawar par zakat ko Ushr kehte hain, barish se sairab hone wali zameen par daswan hissa aur mehnat se sairab hone wali par beeswan hissa, ye point bhi kabhi kabhi a jata hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab ye bhi jaan lo ke zakat kin logon ko di ja sakti hai. Quran Majid ki Surah Tauba me zakat ke aath masarif, yani kharch ki jaghein, bayan hui hain. Pehle fuqara, yani ghareeb log. Dusre masakeen, yani intehai zarurat mand. Teesre wo log jo zakat wasool karne ke kaam par muqarrar hon, unhe amileen kehte hain. Chauthe wo log jin ke dilon ko Islam ki taraf mael karna maqsood ho. Panchwen gardanon ki azadi me, yani ghulamon ko azad karane me. Chhatay qarzdaaron ki madad me. Saatwen Allah ki raah me. Aathwen musafir ki madad me, chahe wo apne sheher me ameer hi kyun na ho, safar me zarurat mand ho to zakat le sakta hai. In aathon ko tartib se nahi to naam se zaroor pehchano, kyunke paper me aik option ghalat daal kar poocha jata hai ke in me se kaun zakat ka mustahiq nahi hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Panchwan rukn, Hajj"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Islam ka panchwan aur aakhri rukn Hajj hai. Hajj zindagi me aik martaba har us musalman par farz hai jo sahib-e-istitaat ho, yani jis ke paas Makkah jaane ka kharcha aur sehat ho. Hajj 9 Hijri me farz hua, ye tareekh paper me poochi jati hai. Pehla Hajj Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ki sarbarahi me nahi hua tha, 9 Hijri me Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddique Radi Allahu Anhu ameer-e-Hajj ban kar gaye, aur 10 Hijri me Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ne apna wahid Hajj ada farmaya jo Hajjat-ul-Wida ke naam se mashhoor hai."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Hajj ke tamam arkan me sab se bara rukn Wuqoof-e-Arafat hai. 9 Zil-Hajj ko Arafat ke maidan me theherna Hajj ki rooh hai. Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka farmaan hai ke Hajj to Arafat hi hai, yani jis ne Arafat ka wuqoof pa liya us ne Hajj pa liya. Isi liye 9 Zil-Hajj ki tareekh aur Arafat ka naam jor kar yaad karo. Hajj ki poori ibadat Hazrat Ibrahim Alaihis Salam ke khandan se nisbatain rakhti hai. Kaaba ki tameer Hazrat Ibrahim aur Hazrat Ismail Alaihimus Salam ne ki. Safa aur Marwa ke darmiyan sai Hazrat Hajra ki yaad hai jo apne bache Hazrat Ismail ke liye pani ki talash me daudi theen. Aur 10 Zil-Hajj ki qurbani Hazrat Ibrahim ki us azeem qurbani ki yaad hai jab wo Allah ke hukam par apne bete ki qurbani ke liye tayyar ho gaye the aur Allah ne us ki jagah dumba bhej diya. Eid-ul-Azha isi yaad me manayi jati hai. Hajj ke dinon me haji ihram bandhta hai, Mina jata hai, Arafat me wuqoof karta hai, Muzdalifa me raat guzarta hai aur Jamarat par kankariyan marta hai. Ye tartib mukhtasar si zehen me rakh lo, tafseel nahi to naam zaroor pehchano."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Iman ke chhe arkan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab dusri taraf aao. Jis tarah Islam ke paanch arkan hain, usi tarah iman ki chhe buniyadein hain, jinhe arkan-e-iman kaha jata hai. Ye Hadees-e-Jibrail me bayan hui hain, jis me Hazrat Jibrail Alaihis Salam insani surat me aye aur Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam se Islam, Iman aur Ihsan ke sawal kiye. Iman ka matlab hai dil se tasdeeq aur yaqeen. Pehla rukn Allah par iman hai, yani Allah aik hai, wo har cheez ka khaliq aur malik hai, us ka koi shareek nahi. Dusra rukn farishton par iman hai, yani Allah ki aik noorani makhlooq farishte hain jo us ke ahkaam bajalate hain aur kabhi nafarmani nahi karte. Teesra rukn Allah ki kitabon par iman hai, yani jo kitabein aur saheefe Allah ne apne rasoolon par nazil farmaye, un sab ko sach manna, aur ye ke Quran un sab me aakhri aur mehfooz kitaab hai. Chautha rukn rasoolon par iman hai, yani Allah ne har dor me hidayat ke liye nabi aur rasool bheje, pehle nabi Hazrat Adam Alaihis Salam hain aur aakhri nabi Hazrat Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam hain, aap ke baad koi nabi nahi aye ga. Panchwan rukn taqdeer par iman hai, yani duniya me jo khair aur sharr hota hai wo Allah ke ilm aur us ki mashiyyat se hai, aur ye yaqeen insaan ko sabr aur shukr dono sikhata hai. Chhata rukn roz-e-aakhirat par iman hai, yani maut ke baad aik din tamam insaan dobara zinda kiye jayenge, un ke aamaal ka hisaab hoga aur jannat aur jahannam ka faisla hoga. Ye chhe baatein dil me pakki ho jayen to iman mukammal hota hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chaar asmani kitabein"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Iman ke teesre rukn ki tafseel bhi paper me poochi jati hai, is liye chaar mashhoor asmani kitabon ko un ke rasoolon ke sath jor kar yaad kar lo. Pehli kitaab Taurat hai, jo Hazrat Musa Alaihis Salam par nazil hui. Dusri kitaab Zabur hai, jo Hazrat Dawood Alaihis Salam ko ata hui. Teesri kitaab Injeel hai, jo Hazrat Isa Alaihis Salam par nazil hui. Chauthi aur aakhri kitaab Quran Majid hai, jo Hazrat Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam par nazil hui, aur ye qiyamat tak mehfooz hai kyunke is ki hifazat ki zimmedari khud Allah ne li hai. In chaaron ke ilawa Allah ne chand rasoolon ko chhote saheefe bhi ata farmaye. Hazrat Ibrahim Alaihis Salam ko diye gaye saheefe Suhuf-e-Ibrahim ke naam se mashhoor hain aur Quran me un ka zikr aya hai. Kitabon ki kul mashhoor tadaad chaar hai, aur saheefe un ke ilawa hain. Sawal yun banta hai ke Zabur kis nabi ko mili, ya sab se pehli asmani kitaab kaun si hai. Pehli ka jawab Taurat hai, kyunke chaar barri kitabon me tartib ke hisaab se wo sab se pehle nazil hui."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Chaar mashhoor farishte aur un ke kaam"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Farishton par iman to parh liya, ab un chaar farishton ko pehchan lo jin ke naam aur kaam paper me bar bar ate hain. Pehle Hazrat Jibrail Alaihis Salam, ye sab se muazzaz farishte hain aur in ka kaam Allah ki wahi nabiyon tak pahunchana tha. Quran me inhe Rooh-ul-Ameen aur Rooh-ul-Qudus bhi kaha gaya hai. Quran Majid ka nuzool Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam par inhi ke zariye hua. Dusre Hazrat Mikail Alaihis Salam, in ke zimme barish aur makhlooq ke rizq ka intezam hai. Teesre Hazrat Israfil Alaihis Salam, in ke haath me soor hai. Jab Allah ka hukam hoga to ye soor phoonken ge jis se qiyamat barpa hogi, aur dusri dafa phoonkne par tamam log dobara zinda ho uthenge. Chauthe Hazrat Izrail Alaihis Salam, inhe Malak-ul-Maut bhi kehte hain aur in ka kaam jaandaron ki rooh qabz karna hai. Farq yun yaad rakho: wahi Jibrail ki, rizq aur barish Mikail ki, soor Israfil ka, aur rooh qabz karna Izrail ka kaam hai. Options me aksar Mikail aur Jibrail ke kaam ulta karke diye jate hain, wahi par kabhi mat phisalna, wahi sirf Jibrail laate the."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paper ke fix facts, aik saans me dohra lo"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab poore lesson ko gin kar dohra lo. Islam ke arkan paanch hain: Shahadat, Namaz, Roza, Zakat, Hajj. Pehla rukn Shahadat hai aur Kalma-e-Tayyaba usi ka naam hai. Namaz Miraj ki raat farz hui aur ye tohfa hai, din me paanch namazain Fajar, Zohar, Asar, Maghrib aur Isha hain, pehli azan Madina me Hazrat Bilal ne di, aur wuzu namaz ki kunji hai. Roza 2 Hijri me farz hua aur us ka maqsad taqwa hai. Zakat me sone ka nisab saarhe saat tola, chandi ka saarhe baawan tola aur sharah dhai feesad hai, masarif aath hain jo Surah Tauba me aye. Hajj 9 Hijri me farz hua, sab se bara rukn Wuqoof-e-Arafat hai jo 9 Zil-Hajj ko hota hai, aur Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ka Hajj Hajjat-ul-Wida 10 Hijri me hua. Iman ke arkan chhe hain: Allah, farishte, kitabein, rasool, taqdeer aur roz-e-aakhirat. Asmani kitabein chaar hain: Taurat Hazrat Musa ko, Zabur Hazrat Dawood ko, Injeel Hazrat Isa ko aur Quran Hazrat Muhammad Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ko mili, aur Suhuf-e-Ibrahim Hazrat Ibrahim ke saheefe hain. Farishte chaar pehchano: Jibrail wahi ke liye, Mikail rizq aur barish ke liye, Israfil soor ke liye, aur Izrail rooh qabz karne ke liye. Ye gin kar yaad ki hui baatein paper me kabhi ghalat nahi hoten, bas hall me jaldi me tartib mat badalna."),
    ],
  ),
];
